This directory stores raw, unprocessed data files as received from sources.

Rules:
  - Files here are IMMUTABLE — never modify raw data directly
  - Raw data is NOT committed to Git (see .gitignore)
  - Use DVC or AWS S3 for large-file storage in production
  - Each pipeline run should store data in a dated subdirectory:
      data/raw/YYYY-MM-DD/source_name/
